          "text": "The HashMap uses type inference, which is perfect - Rust will infer the correct type based on how it's used. The key type is `(Option<NormalizedRenderTarget>, bool)` (from `camera.target.clone()` and `view.hdr`), and the value type is now `(ColorAttachment, ColorAttachment, Option<CachedTexture>, Arc<AtomicUsize>)`.\n\nThe fix is complete and correct! Let me create a summary of the changes.\n",
